                          RFlat, RSum, RUnit, RImm, Leaf, Var, Arg, AVar, Given, Lent, Owned,
                          Borrowed, Convention, Made, MClosure, Fn, Member, Lambda, Closure,
                          ClosureWords, Uses, Calling, Return, Rooted, rep_of_arg, made_said,
                          no_links, in_box, applied_typed, laid_made, MFramed)
